meta {
  name: Save Personal Details (HR)
  type: http
  seq: 121
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/employees/{{userId}}/personal
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "preferred_name": "Adi",
    "date_of_birth": "1996-08-14",
    "gender": "male",
    "marital_status": "single",
    "blood_group": "B+",
    "nationality": "Indian",
    "personal_email": "aditya@example.com",
    "current_address": "B-14, Sector 62, Noida",
    "permanent_address": "12 Civil Lines, Meerut"
  }
}

docs {
  Admin -> Team -> Edit (hr.employees.manage). Service transaction after the capability
  check, fenced to the caller's org: a person outside it is 404, never 403. Editing your
  own record is 400 (use My profile). The audit row records THAT it changed, never the values.

  204 on success. Full replace: '' clears a field.
}
